    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">Given an integer <var>threshold</var> and a sequence of integer measurements, output the values transmitted by the following rule.<br><br>Always transmit the first measurement. Then process the remaining measurements in input order. Transmit a measurement only if its absolute difference from the <strong>last transmitted measurement</strong> is <strong>greater than or equal to</strong> <var>threshold</var>.<br><br>An ignored measurement does not change the reference. A transmitted measurement becomes the new reference.<br><br>For example, with <var>threshold</var> = <const>5</const>, the measurements <const>10 12 15 13 9 4 6</const> produce <const>10 15 9 4</const>. The value <const>12</const> is ignored, so <const>15</const> is compared with <const>10</const>.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> An integer <var>threshold</var>, the minimum absolute difference required for transmission.<br><strong>Line 2:</strong> An integer <var>n</var>, the number of measurements.<br><strong>Line 3:</strong> <var>n</var> space-separated integers <var>measurement</var>, in input order.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\">One line containing the transmitted values in input order, separated by single spaces.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">0 &lt;= <var>threshold</var> &lt;= 2000<br>1 &lt;= <var>n</var> &lt;= 100<br>-1000 &lt;= <var>measurement</var> &lt;= 1000</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">5\n7\n10 12 15 13 9 4 6</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">10 15 9 4</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
